                                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/org#changedBy> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
