<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                     rdfs:comment "Una actividad ocurre en un periodo de tiempo y actúa con o sobre entidades; puede incluir consumir, procesar, transformar, modificar, mover, usar o generar entidades del grafo"@es,
                                                  "An activity is something that occurs over a period of time and acts upon or with entities; it may include consuming, processing, transforming, modifying, relocating, using, or generating entities"@en;
                                     rdfs:label "PROV Activity"@en,
                                                "PROV Actividad"@es.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#SoftwareAgent> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
